SUMMARY:Lancaster Bike Club  Adopt A Highway Cleanup
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nJoin us for a 34 year Lan
 caster Bike Club tradition.\nWhen: Sat. October 17th 7am breakfast\; clean
 up around 8am.\nWhere: Centerville Diner - 100 S. Centerville Road\, Lanca
 ster.\nOur section is a two mile stretch on Columbia Ave between Roherstow
 n Road and Donnerville Road. Park near Painting with a Twist toward the ba
 ck of the lot.\nWhat: Breakfast at Centerville Diner\, followed by cleanup
  (bags\, gloves\, etc are provided)\, then an optional ride.\nWhy: Keep ou
 r longstanding tradition going strong! Help beautify our neighborhood. Enj
 oy the camaraderie of club members!\nFor questions contact Allan at apawli
 ko@comcast.net or 717-682-8063.\n\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you
  are a club member. Use this link to join the club.\n[https://www.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your a
 greement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.club
 express.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https
 ://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&mod
 ule_id=323984)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3139433
 89/
