SUMMARY:All Class Club Ride (Long) WH Three Lakes Loop (40H)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n***Be Safe\, Have Fun\, a
 nd Ride Together***\n\nThis is the October All Club Long Ride.\n\nRoute: [
 https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/wh-3-lakes-loop-40h/](https://rou
 tes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/wh-3-lakes-loop-40h/)\n\nThe ride leader wil
 l ride at the advertised average speed for the [Ride Classifications](http
 s://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id
 =325156). This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the m
 ain goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together 
 with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the sta
 rt.\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the 
 group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and 
 encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining the advertised average p
 ace is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slowe
 r ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and
  a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo 
 eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club memb
 ership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not m
 ean you are a club member.\nJoin here [Member Signup](https://www.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your a
 greement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https:/
 /lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=32
 3984)\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3166697
 80/
