SUMMARY:FUN/CASUAL RIDE - WE Adopt a Highway (14 or more? R) RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Lynn Pfeil\n
 Anticipated Average Pace: 12-14\nRoute: [WE Adopt a Highway (14R)](https:/
 /routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/we-adopt-a-highway-14r-2/)\n**Be Safe\, 
 Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nEnjoy a bike ride after the highway clea
 nup!\n\nThis is a FUN RIDE ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertis
 ed average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule 
 as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group t
 ogether with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups 
 to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are 
 not willing to ride with the group.\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Pl
 ease bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/C
 O2 inflator).\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we req
 uire LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on
  Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](htt
 ps://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYo
 ur RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of
  Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_i
 d=257148&module_id=323984)\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Acti
 ons](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&
 module_id=326137)
