SUMMARY:Impromptu: Round Barn Roundup Winter 20R
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRIDE LEADER: Jon Hartung 
 \, average pace \\~12mph.\nSweep: Ann Morris\n\nCue and Ride with GPS link
 : [Round Barn Roundup Winter](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/49013911)\n**
 Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nThis is a casual ride and the 
 ride leader will ride at the advertised pace. Some riders may ride faster 
 than the leader so we'll likely break into one or more smaller groups with
  stops to regroup periodically. Please stay with other riders in your pace
  group so everyone has someone to ride with and nobody is riding solo.\n\n
 The visitor center has well maintained restrooms that should be open.\n\nP
 ost-ride refreshments - BYO to enjoy at one of the picnic tables near the 
 visitor center.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water a
 nd a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nT
 o eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club me
 mbership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on\nMeetup does no
 t mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancas
 terbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is yo
 ur agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](htt
 ps://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modu
 le_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https:
 //lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=3
 26137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3169958
 93/
