SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- PP Coffee Company New Holland (28R) RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Show-and-Go\
 nRide Sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating sta
 rt location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mile rout
 es\n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” stop for r
 efreshment/coffee mid-route at [Coffee Company New Holland](https://www.co
 ffeecocafe.com/new-holland)\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not
  have a single pace.\nThere will be multiple regroup points during the rid
 e.\nThe CoffeeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected t
 o stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. A 
 planned stop to regroup is recommended. Please be supportive of the other 
 cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the
  last group.\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Rid
 e with GPS](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/pp-coffee-company-new
 -holland-28r/) New Route\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bri
 ng water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 infla
 tor).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require L
 BC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Me
 etup does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is you
 r agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.
 clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \
 ,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?p
 age_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://la
 ncasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)\nIn case of accident\, consult th
 e [Ride Leader Guide](https://s3.amazonaws.com/ClubExpressClubFiles/257148
 /documents/Ride_Leader_Guide_2026_123357428.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6D
 NNJ6ROIH3&Expires=1778249903&response-content-disposition=inline%3B%20file
 name%3DRide_Leader_Guide_2026.pdf&Signature=pwxGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBt
 Q%3D).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3166999
 07/
